    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1bf9f268ba4e405abc0a84a626f8bad1",
      "statement": "A custom settings source reads HC__<NAME>_FILE and substitutes the file's content, ranked after the plain environment so an explicit HC__ variable wins; the production compose docker/compose.yml uses it for the deploy key and the database URL via /run/secrets.",
