      "id": "claim_17c69a73b816414daa99a131a8057ae4",
      "statement": "The production and development compose files pass Dex's DEX_ISSUER and HC_PUBLIC_URL from the registry settings HC__OIDC_ISSUER and HC__PUBLIC_URL (required in production, localhost defaults in development), and the quickstart compose writes the same localhost URLs built from DEX_PORT and REGISTRY_PORT into both the Dex and the registry service, so the operator never supplies the pair twice and the two services cannot diverge.",
